{"content":"{\"chapter_contract_id\":\"contract:v2-n-4-2:v2\",\"node_id\":\"v2_n_4_2\",\"schema_version\":\"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\"known_evidence_ids\":[],\"blocks\":[{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_4_2:para-1\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"本研究为Ⅱ期、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、优效性概念验证研究，适应症为成人慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉，研究对象为成人患者，靶向机制为IL-4Rα及IL-4Rα拮抗。研究采用随机1:1并按中心分层，研究阶段为第1天至第24周（末次给药），第24周评估主要和次要终点；允许稳定背景鼻用激素并记录，无期中分析。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_4_2:para-2\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"对照选择为安慰剂对照：安慰剂为生理盐水1.0 mL皮下注射，采用同体积、同途径、同频率给药。Ⅱ期概念验证采用安慰剂对照以评估合成药X的相对疗效并保持试验敏感性；允许稳定背景鼻用激素并记录。研究假设为合成药X组第24周临床缓解率高于安慰剂组，无效假设为第24周临床缓解率在合成药X组与安慰剂组间无差异；主要分析采用按中心分层的CMH检验，报告风险差及95%CI，双侧α=0.05。预期安慰剂组20%、试验组35%，绝对差15个百分点，把握度为90%；第24周缺失主要终点采用NRI，敏感性分析采用tipping point；关键次要终点SNOT-22采用固定序列检验控制多重性，Lund-Kennedy为描述性分析；无期中分析。上述设计依据、对照选择、假设与证据底线汇总见表1。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_4_2:table-1\",\"kind\":\"table\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"table\":{\"table_id\":\"tbl:v2_n_4_2:design-rationale\",\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_4_2:table-1\",\"title\":\"表1 研究设计依据与假设结构化摘要\",\"domain\":\"generic\",\"role\":\"body_content\",\"header_row_count\":1,\"review_state\":\"ai_draft\",\"version\":0,\"schema_version\":\"structured_table_v1\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"columns\":[{\"column_id\":\"col:item\",\"order\":0,\"label\":\"设计要素\",\"semantic_role\":\"item\",\"style_role\":\"header\"},{\"column_id\":\"col:project-fact\",\"order\":1,\"label\":\"已确认项目事实\",\"semantic_role\":\"project_fact\",\"style_role\":\"header\"},{\"column_id\":\"col:rationale\",\"order\":2,\"label\":\"依据/说明\",\"semantic_role\":\"rationale\",\"style_role\":\"header\"}],\"rows\":[{\"row_id\":\"row:header\",\"order\":0,\"label\":\"表头\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"hdr:item\",\"row_id\":\"row:header\",\"column_id\":\"col:item\",\"text\":\"设计要素\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"hdr:project-fact\",\"row_id\":\"row:header\",\"column_id\":\"col:project-fact\",\"text\":\"已确认项目事实\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"hdr:rationale\",\"row_id\":\"row:header\",\"column_id\":\"col:rationale\",\"text\":\"依据/说明\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:clinical-context\",\"order\":1,\"label\":\"临床背景\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"item:clinical-context\",\"row_id\":\"row:clinical-context\",\"column_id\":\"col:item\",\"text\":\"临床背景\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"fact:clinical-context\",\"row_id\":\"row:clinical-context\",\"column_id\":\"col:project-fact\",\"text\":\"适应症：成人慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉；人群：成人患者；分期：Ⅱ期；研究目标：概念验证；靶向机制：IL-4Rα、IL-4Rα拮抗；设计类型：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、优效性概念验证研究；分配：随机1:1，按中心分层；研究阶段：第1天至第24周（末次给药），第24周评估主要和次要终点；背景治疗：允许稳定背景鼻用激素并记录；期中分析：无。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"rationale:clinical-context\",\"row_id\":\"row:clinical-context\",\"column_id\":\"col:rationale\",\"text\":\"该设计定位于成人慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉的Ⅱ期概念验证，围绕IL-4Rα及IL-4Rα拮抗机制开展，用于在该临床背景中设定对照、假设与统计分析。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:comparator\",\"order\":2,\"label\":\"对照选择\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"item:comparator\",\"row_id\":\"row:comparator\",\"column_id\":\"col:item\",\"text\":\"对照选择\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"fact:comparator\",\"row_id\":\"row:comparator\",\"column_id\":\"col:project-fact\",\"text\":\"对照类型：安慰剂对照（生理盐水1.0 mL皮下注射，同体积、同途径、同频率）；对照：安慰剂；背景治疗：允许稳定背景鼻用激素并记录。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"rationale:comparator\",\"row_id\":\"row:comparator\",\"column_id\":\"col:rationale\",\"text\":\"Ⅱ期概念验证采用安慰剂对照以评估合成药X的相对疗效并保持试验敏感性；允许稳定背景鼻用激素并记录。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:placebo-decision\",\"order\":3,\"label\":\"安慰剂决策\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"item:placebo-decision\",\"row_id\":\"row:placebo-decision\",\"column_id\":\"col:item\",\"text\":\"安慰剂决策\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"fact:placebo-decision\",\"row_id\":\"row:placebo-decision\",\"column_id\":\"col:project-fact\",\"text\":\"适用：是；设计类型：Ⅱ期、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、优效性概念验证研究；安慰剂：生理盐水1.0 mL，皮下注射，同体积、同途径、同频率给药。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"rationale:placebo-decision\",\"row_id\":\"row:placebo-decision\",\"column_id\":\"col:rationale\",\"text\":\"该安慰剂决策来自已确认的结构化项目事实；其理由为Ⅱ期概念验证采用安慰剂对照以评估合成药X的相对疗效并保持试验敏感性，并允许稳定背景鼻用激素并记录。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:hypothesis\",\"order\":4,\"label\":\"研究假设\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"item:hypothesis\",\"row_id\":\"row:hypothesis\",\"column_id\":\"col:item\",\"text\":\"研究假设\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"fact:hypothesis\",\"row_id\":\"row:hypothesis\",\"column_id\":\"col:project-fact\",\"text\":\"无效假设：第24周临床缓解率在合成药X组与安慰剂组间无差异；备择假设：合成药X组第24周临床缓解率高于安慰剂组；主要分析：按中心分层的CMH检验，报告风险差及95%CI；双侧α=0.05；预期效应：安慰剂组20%、试验组35%，绝对差15个百分点；检验：按中心分层的CMH检验，报告风险差及95%CI，双侧α=0.05；把握度：90%；缺失数据：第24周缺失主要终点采用NRI，敏感性分析采用tipping point；多重性：关键次要终点SNOT-22采用固定序列检验控制多重性；Lund-Kennedy为描述性分析；期中分析：无期中分析。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"rationale:hypothesis\",\"row_id\":\"row:hypothesis\",\"column_id\":\"col:rationale\",\"text\":\"假设围绕第24周临床缓解率设定，并以按中心分层的CMH检验、风险差及95%CI和双侧α=0.05进行评价；预期效应、把握度、缺失数据与多重性策略按已确认项目事实用于Ⅱ期概念验证设计。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:evidence-floor\",\"order\":5,\"label\":\"证据底线\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"item:evidence-floor\",\"row_id\":\"row:evidence-floor\",\"column_id\":\"col:item\",\"text\":\"证据底线\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"fact:evidence-floor\",\"row_id\":\"row:evidence-floor\",\"column_id\":\"col:project-fact\",\"text\":\"非劣效性检验：未采用；非劣效性界值：不设定；历史证据底线：不设定；原因：本研究为安慰剂对照优效性设计，未采用非劣效性检验。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"rationale:evidence-floor\",\"row_id\":\"row:evidence-floor\",\"column_id\":\"col:rationale\",\"text\":\"本研究为安慰剂对照优效性设计，未采用非劣效性检验，因此不设定非劣效性界值或历史证据底线。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]}],\"notes\":[]}}]}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"39dce113b17c91d613de9c76635395320fbe2f87c9d4e085abf3001320771aab"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:b2121e5a8044e7cea6d8ca00c69314c51100bb563035d60f8ff295838a65581a:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:b2121e5a8044e7cea6d8ca00c69314c51100bb563035d60f8ff295838a65581a:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"7632818d5ab606762721ff2d17cf3aa657d529f1e8dacc9ff7765aeff48d2eb6","prompt_sha256":"47dd66c834319411962b91127cd952207cccdab4dee7068a9ab81409e5aefa1e","provider_session_id":"c5bbeeae-cfe7-4c45-a593-200a0bed2364","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}